{"synopsis":"Dari Author yang sama dengan Kill the Hero\nMelalui kombinasi dari banyak cedera tulang yang lemah dan kesulitan ekonomi protagonis Lee Jinyong menyerah pada citacitanya untuk menjadi atlet bisbol dan hidup sebagai karyawan pabrik sebagai gantinya Suatu hari jiwa Kim Jinho pahlawan bisbol yang dijuluki sebagai legenda di Korea serta idola Lee Jinyong yang meninggal 10 tahun lalu muncul di hadapannya Pada saat yang sama Notifikasi aneh mulai muncul Baseball Manager akan dimulai dan Lee Jinyong memperoleh kemampuan yang memberinya konstitusi pitcher mirip dengan avatar game Dia kembali ke lapangan untuk menjadi","alternative_title":"Absolute on The Mound, God of Pitcher, God of Baseball","author":"D-Dart, Gaun (가운)","artist":"Meo-yeon (머연), TOGI","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"9a3374fc-7b03-447a-9056-8cb57cbf4be2","number":"77","chapter":"77","title":"Chapter 77","date":"2024-11-26","released":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"09067b9d-ca48-4ae4-9a96-b983830871f1","number":"76","chapter":"76","title":"Chapter 76","date":"2024-12-01","released":"2024-12-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"fbf6c301-4fc2-4cc6-9d4b-e29a1c6d1249","number":"75","chapter":"75","title":"Chapter 75","date":"2024-11-26","released":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"e3926f09-8a53-4cbc-8d3e-eefdb5b59d17","number":"74","chapter":"74","title":"Chapter 74","date":"2024-12-01","released":"2024-12-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"801ec748-2533-48ca-b546-0a4a410399d3","number":"73","chapter":"73","title":"Chapter 73","date":"2024-11-26","released":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"0fdeccf6-ead3-4705-b52d-0f68985b0e2f","number":"72","chapter":"72","title":"Chapter 72","date":"2024-12-01","released":"2024-12-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"68430ace-cd61-4d2a-9399-8139cbdb212c","number":"71","chapter":"71","title":"Chapter 71","date":"2024-12-01","released":"2024-12-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"524748d8-59b4-4c3b-9e10-f48bca743859","number":"70","chapter":"70","title":"Chapter 7